<title>USA: Metropolitan Asset names CEO.</title>
<headline>Metropolitan Asset names CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Asset Management Corp said on Tuesday it had named Cem Gokay as chairman, chief executive and president.</p>
<p>Gokay, Kenneth Wiseman and Lewis Barr were also appointed directors, the company said.</p>
<p>William Gaherty, Joseph Tetley, Sany Marks and Murray Berger have resigned as directors and officers of the company, it said.</p>
<p>The reason for the changes was not given.  </p>
<p>Later, Metropolitan Asset Treasurer Kenneth Wiseman said control of the company had changed hands in the merger of Metropolitan Asset with Diamond Laser International, a maker of lasers.</p>
